# A CLEAN QUIT WITH AN AUX WINDOW OPEN, by a user who keeps windows at a quit
# (docs/traps.md, SwiftUI reopens an aux window after a quit): the relaunched
# app shows its own primary, never a window the guest has not created.
# The Mac's alone: each lane's OFF_SCENES says why the others are off.
expect label#0 "first launch"
expect_windows 2
expect_title window#1 "inspector"
# AppKit writes a window's restorable state a moment after it changes, not
# at once; an act one shorter than that measures nothing.
settle 3000

relaunch resume

expect_title "auxquit"
expect label#0 "second launch"
expect_windows 1
